flowchart LR
  subgraph RackDomain[32 rack-local zones]
    Req[Queued requests] --> Merge[Dispatch-time platter merge]
    Merge --> RS[32 rack-side shuttles]
    RS --> Rack[32 racks × 16 m]
  end
  Rack --> Ports[32 rack-facing ports]
  Ports --> Input[8 input feeder buffers<br/>4 slots per reader]
  Input --> Loaders[8 fixed reader-side loaders]
  Loaders --> Readers[8 optical readers]
  Readers --> Output[Output staging]
  Output -. return task .-> RS
  RS -. platter home .-> Rack
